{"id":"carretera","lemma":"carretera","pos":"noun","rank":1232,"glosses":["road, highway"],"ipa":"/kareˈteɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"carreteras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-carretera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mantén los ojos en la carretera.","en":"Keep your eyes on the road.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609302","words":[{"g":"to keep","l":"mantener"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"eye","l":"ojo"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Esta carretera es terrible.","en":"This road is terrible.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"terrible"}]},{"text":"Vamos de viaje por carretera.","en":"Let's go on a road trip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606584","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"voyage"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"No es una carretera, sino un camino.","en":"It isn't a road, but a path.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821409","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"way, route"}]},{"text":"Vimos tu camión en la carretera.","en":"We saw your truck on the road.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296026","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"lorry"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}